scrcode,BFD|Score like|DNF|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|No|No|No|14||Black flag disqualification under rule 30.4,,
scrcode,DGM|Score like|DSQ|No|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|Yes|No|14||Disqualification not excludable under rule 69.1(b)(2),,
scrcode,DNC|Max boats in start +|1|Yes|No|||spare|spare|spare|spare|No|No|No|14||Did not come to the starting area,,
scrcode,DNE|Score like|DSQ|No|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|Yes|No|14||Disqualification (other then DGM) not excludable under rule 90.3(b),,
scrcode,DNF|Score like|DNC|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|No|No|14||Started but did not finish,,
scrcode,DNS|Score like|DNF|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|No|No|No|14||Came to the start area but did not start,,
scrcode,DPI1|Fixed penalty|1|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|Yes|Yes|14||1 point discretionary penalty,,
scrcode,DSQ|Score like|DNF|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|Yes|No|14||Disqualification,,
scrcode,NSC|Score like|DNF|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|No|No|14||A boat did not sail the course as defined rule A5.1,,
scrcode,OCS|Score like|DNF|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|No|No|No|14||On course side at start or broke rule 30.1,,
scrcode,OOD|Average (all)||Yes|No|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|Yes|No|14||Race officer duty points scored as RDGa,,
scrcode,RDG|Set points by hand||Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|Yes|Yes|14||Redress - points set by protest hearing,,
scrcode,RDGa|Average (all)||Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|Yes|Yes|14||Redress - average points for all races except the race in question,,
scrcode,RDGb|Average (before)||Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|Yes|Yes|14||Redress - average points for all races preceding the race in question,,
scrcode,RET|Score like|DNF|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|No|No|14||Retired,,
scrcode,SCP|Percentage penalty DNF|20|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|Yes|Yes|14||Scoring penalty under rule 44.3,,
scrcode,UFD|Score like|DNF|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|No|No|No|14||U flag disqualification under rule 30.3,,
scrcode,ZFP|Percentage penalty DNF|20|Yes|Yes|||spare|spare|spare|spare|Yes|Yes|Yes|14||20% penalty under rule 30.2,,
